<title>AUSTRALIA: Coates reaffirms prospectus forecasts.</title>
<headline>Coates reaffirms prospectus forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coates Hire Ltd reaffirmed on Tuesday that it was broadly on line to achieve its A$13.3 million net profit forecast for the year to June 30, 1997 in its prospectus.</p>
<p>Answering an Australian Stock Exchange price query, Coates Hire said it anticipated that &quot;profit projections will be broadly in line with the prospectus forecasts made last year.&quot;</p>
<p>Coates' shares have risen 13.5 percent to A$3.35 since May 21. Coates said it could not offer any explanation for the share price rise.  </p>
<p>Coates' shares were down two cents at A$3.33 by 10.10 a.m. (0010 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
